        "TileImage": "$($repository 9e518d13-2941-4573-b044-9285b3aff5aa).Image",
        "Description": "&quot;I may only be a tech reporter but I have ambitions too, you know.&quot;\r\rThe tech reporter found the information that Kronstadt was hiding regarding the Tungan Valley incident. These five individuals, primarily communications experts and medical suppliers, played a role in the war crimes that the Knoxes have committed. Needless to say, give them the same fate as Robert and Sierra Knox.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
